---
/**
 * Marks a draft section in the private preview. It exists only when SHOW_DRAFTS=true,
 * because production builds contain no draft content at all.
 */
---

<p
  data-draft-badge
  class="mb-4 inline-block rounded-sm bg-signal-100 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-sm text-signal-800"
>
  Draft section. Not published.
</p>
